{"id":"src/components/tools/serviceCards.ts","pkg":"src/components","kind":"module","lines":53,"commentLines":9,"header":["The cards of the utility services page, worked out from the registry (src/tools/registry.ts and registry.ui.tsx), never written by hand: every topic that has a page of its own (a calculator or reader) or a live card (prices, news, weather, trains, the guides) is one card, sorted A to Z. A new topic added to the registry appears here by itself, and this file names no topic. Title and sentence: a calculator or reader uses its tile in the list of calculators (so the two lists agree word for word); a live card uses its topic's own name and sentence (topic.ts `intent`). \"Type\": a short sample question of the topic (pickType), which the registry's test proves the topic answers."],"symbols":[{"name":"GROUP_FORMS","kind":"constant","exported":true,"line":14,"sig":"const GROUP_FORMS = \"Calculators & readers\"","type":"","doc":[],"members":[],"items":0,"id":"e9be13ce6f-GROUP_FORMS","usedBy":["src/components/tools/UtilityServicesPage.tsx"]},{"name":"GROUP_INFO","kind":"constant","exported":true,"line":15,"sig":"const GROUP_INFO = \"Information & guides\"","type":"","doc":[],"members":[],"items":0,"id":"e9be13ce6f-GROUP_INFO","usedBy":["src/components/tools/UtilityServicesPage.tsx"]},{"name":"ServiceGroup","kind":"type","exported":true,"line":16,"generics":"","sig":"typeof GROUP_FORMS | typeof GROUP_INFO","doc":[],"id":"e9be13ce6f-ServiceGroup","usedBy":["src/components/tools/UtilityServicesPage.tsx"]},{"name":"ServiceCard","kind":"interface","exported":true,"line":18,"generics":"","extends":"","doc":[],"members":[{"kind":"field","name":"id","line":19,"type":"string","optional":false,"readonly":false,"doc":[]},{"kind":"field","name":"title","line":20,"type":"string","optional":false,"readonly":false,"doc":[]},{"kind":"field","name":"text","line":21,"type":"string","optional":false,"readonly":false,"doc":[]},{"kind":"field","name":"tone","line":22,"type":